# Ragged Short Spear: the discard is optional ("you may discard a card"): Bot1 declines (an empty choice), so no card is
# discarded and, with nothing discarded, "If you do" draws nothing (CR 701.9, 608.2c). The hand is still the one cast from.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ragged Short Spear
Island
Plains
Swamp
Forest
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ragged Short Spear.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Plains; Swamp; Forest
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Ragged Short Spear
